    ("ccma-hipaa", "Protected health information (PHI) includes:", "Individually identifiable health information held by covered entities", ("De-identified data per HIPAA rules", "Only billing codes without identifiers", "Public weather reports"), "PHI ties health data to a person.", (S.NHA_CCMA, S.HHS_HIPAA_PRIVACY,)),
